    "title": "DhaShu Phase 4 API \u2014 blocks 1 and 2",
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "description": "Incremental contract for implemented Phase 4 reads only. Existing Phase 2/3 endpoints retain their contracts. Secure mode (AUTH_ENABLED=1) is required for beta identity. Later journey endpoints are not advertised as callable until implemented."
  },
